		(property "Description" "USB 5V to 3V3 for standalone programming. 3.3V 1A LDO, VIN 2.3-6.0V, dropout 400mV max at 1A, stable with >= 1uF ceramic output cap (22uF max recommended), SOT-223 theta-JA 62C/W (Microchip DS22057B). Pins 1 VIN, 2 GND (tab), 3 VOUT, no SHDN. Alternate: Diodes AP7361C-33E-13 (MPN_ALT, same pinout)."
